BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:BfexpI-frKzvi8Y0i_MWx
SUMMARY:Grease
DTSTAMP:20260724T105411Z
DTSTART:20260802T191500Z
DESCRIPTION:Tell me about it- Stud! Join us for a dragtacular event that's 
	way more electrifying than a high school pep rally! Before we queue up thi
	s campy classic\, we've got a lineup of queens serving looks\, lipsyncs\, 
	and shade that would make Rizzo proud. Expect to be singing\, dancing\, an
	d losing your voice by the end of the night!  Timeline of Events: 🕕 6:30&n
	dash\;7:15 PM &ndash\; Doors Open 💋 7:15- 8:00 PM &ndash\; Drag Performanc
	es  🎬 8:00- 9:45 PM &ndash\; GREASE Screening  Don't be a beauty school dr
	op out! Grab your tickets now.  Please bring $1 bills for tips- we do not 
	carry cash on site Tickets are non-refundable or transferable. If the even
	t is canceled or rescheduled due to inclement weather\, guests will be off
	ered a transfer credit that can be applied towards a future screening. We 
	try our best to reschedule all events and guests can transfer directly to 
	that date.\n\nhttps://rooftopcinemaclub.com/us/houston/uptown/screenings/g
	rease-22866
URL:https://rooftopcinemaclub.com/us/houston/uptown/screenings/grease-22866
GEO:29.7496;-95.4618
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H50M
END:VEVENT
